君のテストに大人さえも答えられない
Even adults can't answer your test,

140
00:14:53,536 --> 00:14:57,536
言葉に詰まる
stumbling for words.

141
00:14:57,536 --> 00:15:01,536
「好きだよ」と全部捨てて
Even though I want to throw everything away

142
00:15:01,536 --> 00:15:06,036
抱き寄せてしまいたいのに
and pull you into an embrace saying "I love you".

143
00:15:06,343 --> 00:15:07,873
電気消して 倒れ込む bed
Turn off the lights and fall onto the bed,

144
00:15:07,993 --> 00:15:09,613
息つく暇もなくて 確かめてよ lips
with no time to catch my breath, confirm with lips.

145
00:15:24,302 --> 00:15:26,652
甘い恋で仕立て
Tailored with sweet love,

146
00:15:26,812 --> 00:15:31,352
アルバムにしてあげた方がいい
it's better to put it in an album.

147
00:15:32,242 --> 00:15:35,672
終わんのよ 続く日々が いつなれば
Days that keep going without end—when will they end?

148
00:15:36,142 --> 00:15:39,742
それがたまらなく怖い きっとあの頃の
That's unbearably scary. Surely, compared to those days...

149
00:15:40,252 --> 00:15:43,842
君の方が 見慣れない愛だなんて
Saying you want unfamiliar love—

150
00:15:43,992 --> 00:15:47,742
サボる制服と 揺れる白日
skipping school in uniform under the swaying daylight.

151
00:15:49,162 --> 00:15:52,782
ふとした言葉も 傷つけてしまう
Even a casual word ends up hurting,

152
00:15:52,942 --> 00:15:56,472
失うものが 何もない
and there's nothing left to lose.

153
00:15:56,652 --> 00:16:00,552
無邪気な目で 苦しめないで
Don't torment me with those innocent eyes.

154
00:16:00,872 --> 00:16:04,432
君のテストに 大人さえも答えられない
Not even an adult can answer your test,

155
00:16:04,682 --> 00:16:08,382
言葉に詰まる 好きだよと全部捨てて
and I stumble over my words, wanting to throw everything away and say "I love you,"

156
00:16:08,642 --> 00:16:12,242
抱きしめてしまいたいのに
even though I just want to hold you tight.

157
00:16:12,402 --> 00:16:16,082
そんな強い心じゃ いられない
I can't stay with a heart that strong.

158
00:16:16,432 --> 00:16:20,432
私の答えに バツをつけて
Put a cross on my answer.

159
00:16:20,732 --> 00:16:24,452
そんな強い心じゃ いられない
I can't stay with a heart that strong.

160
00:16:24,652 --> 00:16:28,432
私の答えに バツをつけて
Put a cross on my answer.

161
00:16:45,932 --> 00:16:49,492
これでいい 君のために
Is this fine? For your sake,

162
00:16:49,652 --> 00:16:53,412
そう決めたのに サル制服へ
even though I decided that—heading toward the uniform...

163
00:16:53,682 --> 00:16:57,422
靡く白日 思わず君を引き止める
the fluttering daylight makes me unconsciously stop you.

164
00:16:58,252 --> 00:17:01,762
好きですか？ の難題に
"Do you love me?" To that difficult question,

165
00:17:02,032 --> 00:17:05,762
許されない答えを書いた
I wrote an unpardonable answer.

166
00:17:06,042 --> 00:17:09,682
君の明日を 縛るだけの
Only binding your tomorrow,

167
00:17:09,942 --> 00:17:13,472
ひとりよがりな 恋の約束
a selfish promise of love.

168
00:17:13,882 --> 00:17:17,572
なら君の悲しむ顔も 見送らなくていいなら
If I don't even have to watch your sad face as you leave,

169
00:17:17,912 --> 00:17:21,602
たとえ悪魔と呼ばれてもいい
I don't care if I'm called a devil.

170
00:17:21,842 --> 00:17:25,522
甘くトロけるような 一時をあなたに
Just a moment of melting sweetness to you.

171
00:18:19,741 --> 00:18:23,381
僕ら並べては皆ほらライアー
When we line up, everyone, look, we're liars.

172
00:18:23,541 --> 00:18:27,201
理屈だなんてゴミ箱は 身に覚えあるんでしょさあ
Excuses belong in the trash. You remember that, right? Come on.

173
00:18:27,621 --> 00:18:31,161
チクチク痛いので
It stings and hurts,

174
00:18:31,321 --> 00:18:34,961
エゴイズムを奪らされて 縋り割れてくアンサー
having our egoism snatched away, answers clinging and breaking apart.

175
00:18:36,891 --> 00:18:39,901
君は傷つけて悪魔っても
Even if you hurt me and are called a devil,

176
00:18:40,391 --> 00:18:42,741
癒やしてあげるもよ
I'll heal you too.

177
00:18:42,841 --> 00:18:44,791
あ、お目覚めですか？
Ah, are you awake?

178
00:18:45,051 --> 00:18:50,261
さあディンドンディンドン響いてディンドン 笑い合ってはっはっとさけんで
Come on, ding-dong, echoing ding-dong, laughing together, shouting "ha-ha!"

179
00:18:50,661 --> 00:18:57,101
ディンドンディンドン鳴らせよディンドン 闇の先こ 読むのをさしてこ
Ding-dong, make it ring, ding-dong. Read ahead into the darkness.

180
00:18:57,631 --> 00:19:03,021
髪突き足すのには 慰めもなしわ 私の胸で
For adding hair-pulling, there's no comfort—on my chest.

181
00:19:04,911 --> 00:19:08,221
明日だのディスタンス
Tomorrow's distance.

182
00:19:19,401 --> 00:19:22,951
闇に惑え甘いチョコにとろけてく
Wandering in the darkness, melting into sweet chocolate.

183
00:19:23,211 --> 00:19:26,821
錆びた鎖繋がれては解いてく
Tied with rusted chains, untying them.

184
00:19:26,971 --> 00:19:30,091
針貫くが飛ばして瞳を貸してく
Piercing needles, skipping, lending your eyes.

185
00:19:30,531 --> 00:19:33,811
目が覚むように奪らされて
Snatched away so that you wake up,

186
00:19:33,971 --> 00:19:37,461
縋り割れてくアンサー アンサー
answers clinging and breaking apart.

187
00:19:37,871 --> 00:19:42,761
間違えて正しくても 癒やしてあげるもよ
Even if it's wrong or right, I'll heal you.

188
00:19:42,761 --> 00:19:43,841
あ、まだだめですか？
Ah, is it still no good?

189
00:19:44,001 --> 00:19:48,981
ディンドンディンドン狂わせディンドン 最後にハッハッと言って
Ding-dong, driving me crazy, ding-dong, finally shouting "ha-ha!"

190
00:19:49,821 --> 00:19:53,431
ディンドンディンドン迷わずディンドン 覚める前に
Ding-dong, without hesitation, ding-dong, before waking up.

191
00:19:54,221 --> 00:19:59,751
口づけをディンドンディンドン 響いてディンドン 笑い合ってはっはっと叫んで
A kiss—ding-dong, echoing ding-dong, laughing together, shouting "ha-ha!"

192
00:20:00,752 --> 00:20:03,552
デンドンデンドン 鳴らせよデンドン
Ding-dong, ding-dong, ring the ding-dong

193
00:20:03,752 --> 00:20:06,752
闇夜のがおさきか 闇夜のがおさきか
Is the dark night going ahead?

194
00:20:07,102 --> 00:20:09,902
髪付きの日のいを
The scent of days attached to hair

195
00:20:10,252 --> 00:20:12,902
慰さむのしおいは
The tide of solace

196
00:20:13,252 --> 00:20:15,652
私 ものいで
As my own thing

197
00:20:16,202 --> 00:20:18,952
明日たらノディスタンス
Tomorrow is No Distance

198
00:20:54,202 --> 00:20:57,702
静かな午後 淡い日差し
A quiet afternoon, faint sunlight

199
00:20:57,702 --> 00:21:01,852
カーテンが揺れる キミの声
Curtains sway, and it's your voice

200
00:21:02,102 --> 00:21:05,902
近づく足音だけで分かる
I know just by your approaching footsteps

201
00:21:06,052 --> 00:21:08,952
さあ 今日はどんな味が お好み？
Now, what flavor do you prefer today?

202
00:21:09,552 --> 00:21:13,652
囁く悪魔の誘惑 what do you want?
A whispering demon's temptation, what do you want?

203
00:21:14,052 --> 00:21:17,452
sickbayで待ち合わせ mistakeなヨカン
Meeting at the sickbay, a mistaken premonition

204
00:21:17,702 --> 00:21:21,852
扉開けて さあこっちへおいて
Open the door and come over here

205
00:21:22,052 --> 00:21:26,202
教科書に載っていない この気持ちは何ですか？
This feeling not found in any textbook—what is it?

206
00:21:26,202 --> 00:21:29,902
可愛い可愛い顔みせて
Show me your cute, cute face

207
00:21:30,052 --> 00:21:33,852
sickbayで会いましょう mistakeしちゃう？
Let's meet at the sickbay, will we make a mistake?

208
00:21:33,852 --> 00:21:37,652
永遠に続け 時間止まって
Continue forever, time, stand still

209
00:21:37,852 --> 00:21:41,702
教室じゃみせられない 笑顔の秘密は
The secret behind the smile you can't show in class

210
00:21:41,902 --> 00:21:46,052
甘い甘いお菓子あげる 囁く悪魔の誘惑 い・か・が
I'll give you sweet, sweet treats. A whispering demon's temptation—how's that?

211
00:21:46,052 --> 00:21:49,902
秒針のリズム 追い越してくる
Overtaking the rhythm of the second hand

212
00:21:57,902 --> 00:22:01,852
聴かせて もっと キミの心拍
Let me hear more of your heartbeat

213
00:22:01,852 --> 00:22:05,902
触れる視線で 身体中
With touching gazes, throughout my body

214
00:22:05,902 --> 00:22:09,852
騒ぐの もうどうしようもないくらい
It stirs up so much I can't help it

215
00:22:09,852 --> 00:22:13,902
禁断の果実 甘い もう後に戻れない
The forbidden fruit is sweet; there's no turning back now

216
00:22:14,052 --> 00:22:17,702
目が合って はにかんで 触れ合って 見つめ合って
Our eyes meet, we smile shyly, touch and gaze at each other

217
00:22:17,852 --> 00:22:21,852
永遠の楽園に 誘う愛の言葉を
Words of love inviting you to an eternal paradise

218
00:22:21,852 --> 00:22:25,852
耳元で 囁いてあげる
Whispered right into your ear

219
00:22:25,852 --> 00:22:29,852
sickbayで待ってるわ mistakeな時間
Waiting at the sickbay, a mistaken time

220
00:22:29,852 --> 00:22:33,852
扉閉めて もっと近づいて
Close the door and come closer

221
00:22:33,852 --> 00:22:37,702
神様も止められない この気持ちの正体を
The true nature of this feeling that even God can't stop

222
00:22:37,702 --> 00:22:41,852
知らないふりは もう出来ない
I can't pretend not to know anymore

223
00:22:41,852 --> 00:22:45,902
sickbayで会いたいのに mistakeしましょう
Even though I want to meet at the sickbay, let's make a mistake

224
00:22:46,052 --> 00:22:49,902
永遠はここにあるって 信じて
Believe that eternity is right here

225
00:22:49,902 --> 00:22:53,902
キミにしかみせられない 笑顔の裏側
The flip side of the smile I only show you

226
00:22:53,902 --> 00:22:57,902
甘い甘い果実あげる 囁く悪魔の誘惑 もっといかが？
I'll give you sweet, sweet fruit. A whispering demon's temptation—want some more?

227
00:22:57,902 --> 00:23:01,902
いつでもここで待って る my cute student ♡
Always waiting right here for you, my cute student

228
00:23:47,102 --> 00:23:51,602
のーでぃーきりすます！
No-dey Christmas!

229
00:23:52,502 --> 00:23:56,852
おどろおどろしい季節 駆け足ですぎ
A spooky season passes by in a rush

230
00:23:56,852 --> 00:24:00,852
銀白も色変わる 真っ赤なセーメリ季節
Even silver-white changes color to a bright red Christmas season

231
00:24:00,852 --> 00:24:03,552
悪魔にそっと告げて
Whisper softly to the devil

232
00:24:03,552 --> 00:24:07,602
至福の奥に溺れる
Drowning deep in bliss

233
00:24:09,402 --> 00:24:12,552
雪降るツリーに
On the snow-falling tree

234
00:24:12,552 --> 00:24:16,052
欲張りなお願いの山
A mountain of greedy wishes

235
00:24:16,052 --> 00:24:19,552
走って言われると
When told to run

236
00:24:19,552 --> 00:24:23,052
いじわるしせくぬちゃうな
It makes me want to tease you

237
00:24:25,052 --> 00:24:29,552
ちゃんとお願いをして
Make your wish properly

238
00:24:29,552 --> 00:24:33,552
のーでぃーきりすます
No-dey Christmas

239
00:24:33,552 --> 00:24:37,102
悪い子にはご褒美が
Bad children get a reward

240
00:24:37,102 --> 00:24:43,102
サンタより悪魔はいかが 願いをかけてあげる
How about a devil instead of Santa? I'll grant your wish

241
00:24:52,602 --> 00:24:56,602
また何が変わった？ ごひずりさん
What changed again? Gohizuri-san

242
00:24:56,602 --> 00:25:00,052
Welcome to my spooky scary Sickbay

243
00:25:00,304 --> 00:25:02,174
おどろおどろしい季節駆け足で過ぎ
The grim and eerie season passes in a hurry,

244
00:25:02,174 --> 00:25:04,004
純白も色を変える
even pure white changes its color.

245
00:25:04,004 --> 00:25:06,024
真っ赤な聖なる季節悪夢に衝突して
The bright red holy season collides with a nightmare,

246
00:25:06,024 --> 00:25:07,944
漆黒の雲に覆われる
covered by pitch-black clouds.

247
00:25:09,254 --> 00:25:11,954
雪降るツリーによくばりなお願いの山
A mountain of greedy wishes on the snowy tree.

248
00:25:11,954 --> 00:25:13,464
ほしいって言われると
When you say you want it,

249
00:25:13,464 --> 00:25:15,234
いじわるしたくなっちゃうな
I can't help wanting to tease you.

250
00:25:15,484 --> 00:25:16,954
「ちゃんとお願いして？」
"Can you beg for it properly?"

251
00:25:16,954 --> 00:25:18,644
のーばでぃーくりすます！
Nobody's Christmas!

252
00:25:18,644 --> 00:25:20,044
悪い子にはご褒美なし
No reward for bad children,

253
00:25:20,044 --> 00:25:22,544
サンタより悪魔はいかが？
how about a devil instead of Santa?

254
00:25:23,354 --> 00:25:25,224
願いを叶えてあげる
I'll grant your wish,

255
00:25:25,224 --> 00:25:28,284
また罠にかかった子羊さん
another little lamb caught in a trap.

256
00:25:29,294 --> 00:25:32,514
welcome to my spooky scary sickbay

257
00:25:32,514 --> 00:25:36,154
聖夜もゴーストパーティーももう私のもの
Both the holy night and the ghost party are mine.

258
00:25:36,154 --> 00:25:38,194
もちろんそこの隙間ないキミも
Of course, that slippery fool there too.

259
00:25:38,194 --> 00:25:40,574
あれもこれもって
This and that...

260
00:25:40,574 --> 00:25:42,574
目移りして困ってない？
Aren't your eyes wandering?

261
00:25:42,574 --> 00:25:44,504
そんなほしいものリスト
That kind of wishlist

262
00:25:44,504 --> 00:25:46,554
消しておきました
I've already erased.

263
00:25:46,554 --> 00:25:48,364
「欲望さらけだして」
"Expose your desires."

264
00:25:48,364 --> 00:25:50,194
のーばでぃーくりすます！
Nobody's Christmas!

265
00:25:50,194 --> 00:25:52,404
ツリーの下にびっくり箱
A surprise box under the tree,

266
00:25:52,404 --> 00:25:54,504
驚いた表情はケーキよりデリシャスです
your surprised expression is tastier than cake.

267
00:25:54,504 --> 00:25:57,264
もっと見せてその表情
Show me that expression even more!

268
00:25:57,974 --> 00:25:59,854
良い子なふりしてるだけでしょう？
You're just pretending to be a good kid, right?

269
00:25:59,854 --> 00:26:01,814
昼夜逆転しちゃってるんでしょう？
Your day and night are reversed, aren't they?

270
00:26:01,814 --> 00:26:04,084
プレゼントもういらないんでしょう？
You don't need presents anymore, do you?

271
00:26:04,084 --> 00:26:07,254
だって私だけいれば満足でしょう？
Because you'd be satisfied with just me, right?

272
00:26:07,574 --> 00:26:10,034
その靴下の中に
Inside that stocking,

273
00:26:10,034 --> 00:26:12,474
甘い誘惑をin
I put a sweet temptation in.

274
00:26:12,474 --> 00:26:14,464
諦めておいて
Just give up and accept it—

275
00:26:14,654 --> 00:26:16,154
ah christmas for nobody

276
00:26:17,004 --> 00:26:18,784
のーばでぃーくりすます！
Nobody's Christmas!

277
00:26:18,784 --> 00:26:21,034
悪い子が夜更かししてる
Bad kids staying up late,

278
00:26:21,034 --> 00:26:23,154
クソガキにunholy night
an unholy night for brats.

279
00:26:23,154 --> 00:26:25,684
甘い甘いお仕置きです
A sweet, sweet punishment!

280
00:26:25,984 --> 00:26:28,284
聖夜の前だけいい子のふりして
Pretending to be good right before the holy night,

281
00:26:28,284 --> 00:26:30,344
飴もらおうって企みなんて
scheming to get some candy...

282
00:26:30,344 --> 00:26:32,524
甘いんですほらほらよろこんで！
how naive! Come on, rejoice!

283
00:26:32,524 --> 00:26:35,204
恐怖と惑わげちゃうね
I'll fill you with terror and bewilderment!

284
00:26:41,984 --> 00:26:43,884
のーばでぃーくりすます！
Nobody's Christmas!

285
00:27:09,418 --> 00:27:12,868
のーばでぃーくりすます！
Nobody's Christmas!

286
00:27:34,418 --> 00:27:36,918
Watch Me
[Title: Watch Me]

287
00:27:40,468 --> 00:27:43,468
巡り合う糸はきっと
The threads that cross paths

288
00:27:43,468 --> 00:27:47,168
絡まるようになってる
are bound to tangle together.

289
00:27:47,168 --> 00:27:50,718
リアルで感じる熱は
The warmth felt in reality

290
00:27:50,718 --> 00:27:54,068
本物の誘惑
is a genuine temptation.

291
00:27:54,118 --> 00:27:57,768
時々高鳴る鼓動は焦り速度が追いつけない
My beating heart races too fast to catch up.

292
00:27:57,768 --> 00:28:00,768
期待の先に映る
Reflected beyond my expectations,

293
00:28:00,768 --> 00:28:04,568
キミがいて 目に見えないメロディが
you are there, and an invisible melody

294
00:28:04,568 --> 00:28:07,568
弾ける気がしたの
feels like it's about to burst.

295
00:28:08,118 --> 00:28:14,618
ときめきは いつまでも変わらない夢の証でしょう
This excitement is proof of an unchanging dream.

296
00:28:15,618 --> 00:28:22,118
願いごと集めてく カラフルに彩る通り それじゃパシャっと
Gathering wishes along a colorful street, now snap!

297
00:28:22,118 --> 00:28:29,118
決めポーズ リズムに合わせてダンスダンス 踊ろうよ 踏み出して
Strike a pose, dance to the rhythm! Come on, take a step forward.

298
00:28:29,118 --> 00:28:35,118
全身のハートで見せつけていく これでもおそと おなじ
Show it off with all your heart, even outside it's the same.

299
00:28:35,618 --> 00:28:42,618
最後はぎゅっと 決めポーズ リズムに合わせてダンスダンス 踊ろうよ 駆け抜けて
Finish with a tight pose, dance to the rhythm! Run all the way through.

300
00:28:43,118 --> 00:28:49,118
天使の微笑み ドキドキさせて これでもおそと 同じだね
Make my heart race with an angel's smile, even outside it's the same.

301
00:28:56,618 --> 00:29:00,618
だらだらしてたら お昼まで進めず
Lazing around gets us nowhere by noon.

302
00:29:01,118 --> 00:29:03,618
腹ぺこへっこ取る おなかからグー
A hungry stomach growls, "Goo!"

303
00:29:03,918 --> 00:29:07,118
あつまってカフェで決めた 暗号は 最後であげた
The secret code decided at the café was given at the end.

304
00:29:07,618 --> 00:29:10,618
まったり編たり案外のんびり悪くないね 迷走中
Relaxing and knitting isn't half bad while wandering.

305
00:29:11,118 --> 00:29:14,118
時々高鳴る鼓動は心拍数まだ追いつけない
My racing heart still can't keep up with the pulse.

306
00:29:14,618 --> 00:29:17,618
直流に微笑む キミがいて
You smile right before my eyes,

307
00:29:18,118 --> 00:29:24,118
風邪気味で届いた日の 魔法みたいにずっと
like magic on that day I caught a cold.

308
00:29:25,118 --> 00:29:31,118
友達は いつまでも 忘れない 想いを広げて
Spreading feelings we'll never forget as friends,

309
00:29:32,118 --> 00:29:38,118
どこまでも 続いてく 同じ未来を見つめたい
I want to look toward the same future stretching on forever.

310
00:30:00,254 --> 00:31:01,454
ゃらりぱっぱりぱっぱりらっぱ
Lali-pa-pala-pa-pa-pala-pa,

311
00:31:01,454 --> 00:31:02,854
私の心の距離
the distance between our hearts

312
00:31:02,854 --> 00:31:05,884
おつなぐいと
connected by a single thread.

313
00:31:06,254 --> 00:31:07,584
準備はOK？
Are you ready?

314
00:31:07,884 --> 00:31:08,684
それじゃぱんぱん！
Here we go!

315
00:31:08,884 --> 00:31:12,234
早速ポーズを教せてだった
Let's strike a quick pose,

316
00:31:12,234 --> 00:31:15,484
踊ろうよ輝いて
and dance while shining bright!

317
00:31:15,484 --> 00:31:18,884
天使の言葉でとりこにしてく
Captivating you with angelic words,

318
00:31:18,884 --> 00:31:21,934
これでもおそなじ
even then, we're the same.

319
00:31:22,234 --> 00:31:25,934
最後はギュッと締めポーズ 心に訪ねてだった
Finally, a tight closing pose, asking in our hearts,

320
00:31:25,934 --> 00:31:29,134
踊ろうよ飛び込んで
let's dance and dive right in,

321
00:31:29,134 --> 00:31:32,534
天使の微笑みドキドキさせて
making hearts race with an angel's smile!

322
00:31:32,534 --> 00:31:35,634
これでもおそなじだね
Even then, we're the same.

323
00:31:58,134 --> 00:31:59,134
(sweetest love)

324
00:32:12,634 --> 00:32:14,334
聞いて 会いたいのに 飛んできて
Listen, I want to see you, fly over here!

325
00:32:14,334 --> 00:32:17,134
すここまるくらいに おねだり
Begging you just enough to trouble you.

326
00:32:17,134 --> 00:32:19,634
ねぇちょっと聞いて見て受け取って
Hey, listen, look, and take it in,

327
00:32:19,634 --> 00:32:23,634
甘くとめまいしちゃうような時を
a time so sweet it makes me dizzy.

328
00:32:28,934 --> 00:32:36,134
疲れ顔して いつもたくさん頑張ってるね
You look tired, always working so hard,

329
00:32:36,134 --> 00:32:43,134
もう全部流して 全部食べてあげようか
should I wash it all away and eat it all up for you?

330
00:32:43,634 --> 00:32:50,134
よそ見なんて嫌だよ ちゃんとこっち向いていなっちょ
Looking away is no good, look right here at me!

331
00:32:50,634 --> 00:32:57,934
目と目が合うでしょ 痺れちゃうくらい見つめてね
Our eyes meet, right? Look at me till you're numb!

332
00:32:58,334 --> 00:33:04,634
ひとつ 夢中にさせて ふたつ 見つけてね
One, get lost in a dream. Two, find me.

333
00:33:05,134 --> 00:33:11,934
もういっか とりこにしちゃうな 心拍数急上昇
Whatever, let's get captivated, heart rate skyrocketing!

334
00:33:12,334 --> 00:33:15,634
好きよ
I love you!

335
00:33:16,134 --> 00:33:19,634
いたいのはい の飛んできて
I want to see you, fly over here,

336
00:33:19,634 --> 00:33:22,634
不安な顔より笑顔みせて
show a smile instead of worry!

337
00:33:22,634 --> 00:33:26,634
ねぇちょっと聞いて見て受け取って
Hey, listen, look, and take it in,

338
00:33:26,634 --> 00:33:29,634
甘いチョコのような時を
a time like sweet chocolate!

339
00:33:29,934 --> 00:33:37,134
ここにいたいのに いつのまに欲張っちゃう
I want to stay here, but before I know it, I get greedy,

340
00:33:37,134 --> 00:33:44,134
冬の日にちょっとひとくち 散らしちゃうわよ 食べもちょっと
taking a little bite on a winter day and scattering it around!

341
00:33:44,334 --> 00:33:51,634
不安なんて抱えて らしくないのなんて思ってた
Carrying worries and thinking "that's not like me,"

342
00:33:51,934 --> 00:33:59,634
全部全部まるごと 包み込んで溶かしてあげる
I'll wrap it all up and melt it away for you.

343
00:34:13,634 --> 00:34:20,134
どうして 何してても 気持ちは同じなんだね
No matter what we do, our feelings are the same.

344
00:34:20,634 --> 00:34:27,634
ここだって どこだって 想いは伝わるから
Right here, anywhere, our thoughts get through.

345
00:34:27,934 --> 00:34:34,634
声にして 文字にして 勇気出して好きって伝えて
Put it in voice, put it in words, find the courage to say "I love you."

346
00:34:35,134 --> 00:34:42,634
今日だって いつだって 愛し返すの
Today and always, returning your love!

347
00:34:42,634 --> 00:34:43,634
(sweetest love)

348
00:34:43,634 --> 00:34:46,634
隠さないでちゃんと教えて
Don't hide it, tell me properly!

349
00:34:46,634 --> 00:34:49,134
キミのこと全部を
Everything about you—

350
00:34:49,134 --> 00:34:52,634
ちょーだい
give it to me!

351
00:34:52,634 --> 00:34:59,134
聞いて 会いたいのに 飛んできて
Listen, I want to see you, fly over here!

352
00:34:59,134 --> 00:35:00,134
少し困るくらいにお願い
Begging you just enough to trouble you.

353
00:35:27,270 --> 00:35:29,330
あした起きたら
If I wake up tomorrow,

354
00:35:29,530 --> 00:35:33,350
夢だと思うかな
I wonder if it'll feel like a dream.

355
00:35:34,170 --> 00:35:38,390
いっぱいの光と音
Filled with light and sound,

356
00:35:38,390 --> 00:35:44,410
私を連れ出して
lead me away.

357
00:35:46,150 --> 00:35:51,650
ユーフォリア
Euphoria

358
00:35:53,030 --> 00:35:56,090
ふたり世界は
Our world is

359
00:35:56,090 --> 00:35:59,950
甘くて優しくて 恋い焦がれた
sweet, gentle, and deeply yearned for.

360
00:36:00,170 --> 00:36:06,470
そんな感情 初めてで 出会えたんだよ
It's my first time feeling this way—I'm so glad I met you.

361
00:36:07,050 --> 00:36:10,050
ねえ 聞かせてみて
Hey, let me hear it—

362
00:36:10,330 --> 00:36:14,630
その歌で合図して 叩いて
give me a sign with your song and beat the rhythm.

363
00:36:15,250 --> 00:36:17,510
うん 濃厚だよ
Yeah, it's so rich and deep.

364
00:36:17,890 --> 00:36:21,190
これからもよろしくね
Please take care of me from now on too.

365
00:36:21,450 --> 00:36:25,150
隣歩いて行きたいな
I want to walk side by side with you.

366
00:36:25,450 --> 00:36:31,150
あふれそうな想いが こんなにも胸をしめつけるんだとして
If these overflowing feelings tighten my chest so much,

367
00:36:32,550 --> 00:36:38,950
なぜうまく言葉にできないよ
why can't I put it into words well?

368
00:36:40,230 --> 00:36:43,890
あなたを想うよりも
More than just thinking of you,

369
00:36:43,890 --> 00:36:47,510
私をしあわせだよ
it makes me so happy.

370
00:36:48,010 --> 00:36:52,630
この手の温もりが 大切で愛しい
The warmth of this hand is precious and dear—

371
00:36:52,630 --> 00:36:56,750
マイ ユーフォリア
my euphoria.

372
00:37:01,950 --> 00:37:05,270
ふたり世界は
Our world is

373
00:37:05,270 --> 00:37:09,430
色づくきらめいて 焦らないな
colorful, sparkling, and unhurried.

374
00:37:09,930 --> 00:37:15,950
まだまだ知らないが 楽しんだ
There's still so much we don't know, let's enjoy it.

375
00:37:16,610 --> 00:37:19,590
ねえ 紡いでみよう
Hey, let's spin it together—

376
00:37:19,910 --> 00:37:24,030
続きの話を もう一度って
asking to hear the continuation once more.

377
00:37:24,490 --> 00:37:26,670
うん ありがとうだよ
Yeah, thank you so much.

378
00:37:27,090 --> 00:37:30,350
お待たせ そのその先で
Sorry to keep you waiting, and beyond that,

379
00:37:30,510 --> 00:37:33,810
あなた笑っていてくれて 嬉しいの
I'm so glad to see you smiling.

380
00:37:34,110 --> 00:37:40,050
ズルイよ
It's unfair...

381
00:37:44,350 --> 00:37:49,350
the future with you, I will be smiling

382
00:37:57,010 --> 00:38:00,790
お互い笑顔でいよ
Let's both keep smiling.

383
00:38:00,990 --> 00:38:04,730
終わりの日も変わらずに
Even on our final day, unchanging,

384
00:38:04,930 --> 00:38:09,430
これからのことを思うたび
every time I think of the future ahead,

385
00:38:09,750 --> 00:38:13,190
少しだけ泣いちゃうような
I feel like crying a little bit—

386
00:38:13,390 --> 00:38:19,130
あれ この気持ちどう伝えがせないよ
ah, how can I convey this feeling?

387
00:38:19,890 --> 00:38:23,810
あなたといられるから
Because I get to be with you,

388
00:38:23,810 --> 00:38:27,550
私をしあわせだよ
it makes me so happy.

389
00:38:27,910 --> 00:38:31,990
一瞬の足音が 特別で愛しい
The sound of our footsteps in this fleeting moment is special and dear—

390
00:38:31,990 --> 00:38:36,130
マイ ユーフォリア
my euphoria.

391
00:38:56,150 --> 00:39:02,150
はーい、ということで、ここまでいかがだったでしょうかー！
Ha~i! So, how was it up to this point?!

392
00:39:03,650 --> 00:39:12,150
たくさんチョコのお友達たちが来てくれました！ありがとうー！
Lots of Choco's friends came to see us! Thank you so much!

393
00:39:13,150 --> 00:39:24,150
まあね、いよいよライブも終盤ですが、最後まで楽しんでいってくださいくださーい！
Well, we're finally reaching the climax of the live show, so please enjoy it all the way to the end!

394
00:39:25,150 --> 00:39:34,150
そしてそして、このステージどうですかー？
And, and... how do you like this stage?

395
00:39:35,150 --> 00:39:42,150
まあ最初はチョコでコーディングされたシックでかっこいいお城だったんですけどー
Well, at first it was a chic and cool castle themed around Choco...

396
00:39:42,150 --> 00:39:52,150
みんなと踊って、その熱と手々でチョコが暑苦しくて取れちゃいました！
But after dancing with everyone, with all that passion and warmth, Choco got so hot she took it off!

397
00:39:54,150 --> 00:40:00,150
見てよみんな！もうね、ビターチョコから
Look at everyone! From being bitter Choco...

398
00:40:00,487 --> 00:40:02,487
ツイートでキュートなホワイトチョコに
To the cute white chocolate on Twitter,

399
00:40:03,647 --> 00:40:06,827
ピンチが早変わり
the pinch quickly changes!

400
00:40:17,867 --> 00:40:22,067
まあ、みんなはどっちの方が好みだったかは
Well, which one did everyone prefer?

401
00:40:22,647 --> 00:40:29,167
まあ、あとの感想でぜひぜひ 教えてください
Please be sure to let me know in your feedback later!

402
00:40:32,067 --> 00:40:41,467
まあね、ま、この続きはちょっとまだゲストパートなんですけど、まあね
Well, this continuation is still the guest part, but...

403
00:40:43,267 --> 00:40:49,067
最後 誰がどうなっちゃうのかな
In the end, who will turn out how?

404
00:40:51,267 --> 00:40:54,967
まあちょっと予想してみてください
Well, try to guess!

405
00:40:55,467 --> 00:40:57,967
はーい！
Yes!

406
00:40:59,967 --> 00:41:03,967
それでは 最後ね
Well then, finally...

407
00:41:05,267 --> 00:41:12,567
ま、最後って言っても全体では最後じゃないけど、ゲストパートは最後なんだ
Well, even if I say finally, it's not the overall end, but the guest part is the end.

408
00:41:13,067 --> 00:41:18,067
みんなちゃんと楽しんでる？いけてますか？
Is everyone enjoying it properly? Are you doing well?

409
00:41:19,567 --> 00:41:25,967
本当いつもお祝いしてくれてありがとう。じゃあ、最後のゲストパート曲も
Thank you as always for celebrating. Well then, for the final guest part song...

410
00:41:28,167 --> 00:41:32,167
盛り上がっていくぞ！
Let's get hyped!

411
00:41:33,367 --> 00:41:38,967
それでは聞いてください。どうぞ！
Now then, please listen. Here we go!

412
00:42:13,967 --> 00:42:16,367
さあさ この指に止まれ
Come on, catch this finger.

413
00:42:16,567 --> 00:42:19,367
後悔あとでしても知らないぞ
You'll regret it later if you don't know!

414
00:42:19,667 --> 00:42:24,167
音に呑まれて、歌って踊って満たすだけ
Swallowed by the sound, just singing, dancing, and fulfilling it.

415
00:42:24,167 --> 00:42:26,667
パンパン 手を打ち鳴らして
Clap, clap, clapping your hands,

416
00:42:26,667 --> 00:42:29,967
ソソソラシド ん な五線譜も
even on such a so-so-sol-la-ti-do staff,

417
00:42:30,167 --> 00:42:34,367
音色を敷いて、今 導き出すよ
laying out the tone, I'll guide it out now.

418
00:42:34,967 --> 00:42:37,767
正体は 実は 案外 歯がゆいもの
The true identity is actually surprisingly frustrating.

419
00:42:37,767 --> 00:42:44,367
魔法のタクト、空にかざすだけ
Just holding the magic baton up to the sky.

420
00:42:45,167 --> 00:42:50,567
おいでよ 街を包み込んだ 超常現象が
Come on, the paranormal phenomenon wrapping around the town

421
00:42:50,567 --> 00:42:54,567
夜空に、ほら こだまして 退屈が泣き出す
echoes in the night sky, making boredom start to cry.

422
00:42:54,567 --> 00:43:00,167
孤独な 愛を埋めよう 最終 妄想的 のクターンが
Let's fill the lonely love. The final illusory nocturne...

423
00:43:01,467 --> 00:43:03,967
君は 聞こえた？ 星に舞う旋律を
Did you hear it? The melody dancing in the stars.

424
00:43:03,967 --> 00:43:07,267
ワンツーさんしで 泣いていた
Crying with one, two, three, four,

425
00:43:07,267 --> 00:43:12,367
過去に負けない めぐる力の
turning the power that won't lose to the past,

426
00:43:12,367 --> 00:43:17,467
た・た・楽しいリズムで 途切れ無い音を乗せてたったん
carrying unbroken notes with a fun, fun rhythm.

427
00:43:28,567 --> 00:43:32,567
痛い愛を描こう セプテット
Let's draw painful love, Septet.

428
00:43:33,367 --> 00:43:39,267
忘れてた 景色 の向こうの その向こう
Forgotten scenery, beyond and beyond.

429
00:43:39,267 --> 00:43:41,967
未達 調和のほころび
Unreached harmony's fray,

430
00:43:41,967 --> 00:43:44,767
モノクロの望遠鏡
monochrome telescope.

431
00:43:44,767 --> 00:43:49,067
待った私の ぶっつけ本番で 奏でよう
Wait, let's play it in my impromptu performance.

432
00:43:49,167 --> 00:43:55,367
理想 輝く 幻想的 思考で いつも目が合うあいつと
With ideal, glowing, fantastical thoughts, with that guy whose eyes always meet mine,

433
00:43:55,367 --> 00:44:05,567
手を繋ぎ踊ろう 何度も泣いて泣いた 心のエレジーを
let's hold hands and dance, the elegy of a heart that cried and cried so many times.

434
00:44:06,167 --> 00:44:12,567
僕は聴こえた だから今ここにいるんだ
I heard it, that's why I'm here now.

435
00:44:33,467 --> 00:44:39,167
招待は 実は 案外 悲しいもの
The invitation is actually surprisingly sad.

436
00:44:39,167 --> 00:44:44,467
魔法の音色、空に響かせて
Let the magic tone resonate through the sky.

437
00:44:47,167 --> 00:44:52,567
おいでよ 街を包み込んだ 超常現象が
Come on, the paranormal phenomenon wrapping around the town

438
00:44:52,567 --> 00:44:55,967
夜空に、ほら こだまして 退屈が泣き出す
echoes in the night sky, making boredom start to cry.

439
00:44:55,967 --> 00:45:00,167
愉快な 歌を歌おう 最終
Let's sing a cheerful song, the final...

440
00:45:00,504 --> 00:45:02,044
アンサンブルを
The ensemble...

441
00:45:02,044 --> 00:45:03,384
君は聞こえた
Did you hear it?

442
00:45:03,384 --> 00:45:05,804
星にまう旋律を
The melody dancing among the stars

443
00:45:08,304 --> 00:45:10,744
ワンツースリーシで泣いてた
Crying on one, two, three, four...

444
00:45:11,144 --> 00:45:13,744
過去に負けない巡る力を
The power to not lose to the past

445
00:45:14,224 --> 00:45:18,024
タンタン楽しいリズムで途切れない音をのせてた
Riding a joyful, uninterrupted rhythm

446
00:45:19,644 --> 00:45:23,824
パンパン手打ち鳴らして 踊れ踊れ 大怪獣トラ！
Clap your hands and dance, dance, giant monster tiger!

447
00:45:24,564 --> 00:45:29,184
バイバイ今夜はさよなら 次は君もステージで タタン！
Bye-bye tonight, next time you're on stage too!

448
00:45:30,164 --> 00:45:35,304
さあさあこの指にとまれ 後悔あとでしても知らないぞ
Take my hand, you'll regret it if you miss out!

449
00:45:35,564 --> 00:45:39,644
耳をすまして 僕らと踊るだけ
Listen closely, just dancing along with us

450
00:45:52,444 --> 00:45:55,944
はーい！ちょくまろ全員集合！うわー！イエーイ！
Hii! Chokumaro, everyone gather! Woah! Yay!

451
00:45:56,424 --> 00:45:58,184
イェーイ！イェーイ！イェーイ！イェーイ！
Yay! Yay! Yay! Yay!

452
00:46:03,984 --> 00:46:06,844
いや今日のちょくちょく食べてくれてありがとう！
Thanks so much for eating Choco-stuff today!

453
00:46:07,624 --> 00:46:09,704
いや、こちらこそ！ありがとうございます！
No, thank you! Thank you very much!

454
00:46:10,324 --> 00:46:14,404
え、ちょこせん誕生日おめでとう！おめでとう！わーい！
Um, Choco-sen, happy birthday! Happy birthday! Yay!

455
00:46:15,284 --> 00:46:17,004
ケーキ食べた？食べた！食べた！おめでとうございます！
Did you eat cake? I did! I did! Happy birthday!

456
00:46:17,764 --> 00:46:22,964
いや、もし幸せだわちょこ、ちょっとケーキ持ってくればよかった、忘れちゃったわ！
Man, I'm so happy, Choco. I should've brought some cake, I forgot!

457
00:46:24,544 --> 00:46:27,604
忘れてた！いや、まあまあ、今日はね
I forgot! Well, anyway, today...

458
00:46:28,704 --> 00:46:33,024
じゃあちょっとちょこの誕生日プレゼントにちょっとちょこに付き合ってもらってもいいですか？
Um, for Choco's birthday present, would you keep Choco company?

459
00:46:33,584 --> 00:46:35,284
いいよ、もちろん！
Sure, of course!

460
00:46:38,464 --> 00:46:41,004
ちょっとちょこみんなとやりたいことがあって
Choco has something she wants to do with everyone...

461
00:46:41,384 --> 00:46:43,784
え、何？何？なんだろ？
Eh, what? What? What is it?

462
00:46:44,924 --> 00:46:50,264
あのー、ちーと一一緒にグッズ告知してほしいな、世界！
Um, I want everyone to help announce the goods together!

463
00:46:51,284 --> 00:46:53,484
一緒に？いいでしょ？
Together? Sounds good, right?

464
00:46:54,124 --> 00:46:57,424
いいでしょ、ちょっとなんかピキッとした、今。いいでしょ。
Sounds good, you look a bit tense right now. Sounds good.

